- Replace the _import_failed shim modules and
  the zzzz-import-failed-hooks.pth file with
  upstream's --with-missing-stdlib-config. Add a
  missing-stdlib-config.json.in with the zypper hints for the
  subpackages and drop import_failed.py and import_failed.map.
  Missing stdlib modules now raise a regular ModuleNotFoundError
  whose printed message carries the hint, instead of a shim
  raising ImportError. More information in PACKAGING-NOTES.

