- Require libexpat1 >= 2.8.5 for python311-base and raise
  the Expat build requirement accordingly. pyexpat uses
  XML_SetHashSalt16Bytes when built with Expat >= 2.8, but the
  automatic SONAME dependency permits older libraries, breaking
  imports and venv/ensurepip (bsc#1285433).

